  (text "POWER INPUT & PROTECTION\nF1 is the ONLY element between J1(+) and the rest of the board.\nD1 (reverse crowbar) sits electrically immediately behind F1.\nSilkscreen: large filled + (J1.1) and - (J1.2); variant text field: 26V MAX (24V BOM) / 58V MAX (56V BOM)."
    (at 38.1 33.02 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 2 2)))
    (uuid "8e7da86f-652d-47dd-88ed-f3d90c838b02"))

  (text "Bulk bank C4-C11 returns ONLY through Q1/R1 (BULK_RTN).\nPrecharge via R1 100R: tau ~0.35s. Q1 enhances from +12V rail\nthrough R2; D3 clamps VGS at 10V. One PCB, two BOMs:\nvalues shown 24V-BOM | 56V-BOM on the same footprint."
    (at 152.4 104.14 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5)))
    (uuid "015532c0-c583-4334-8fba-de6357d20670"))

